text to answer questions number 9-11\nDear Betty,\n\nI\'m writing to you concerning of my last day in Jogja. I just got back from Borobudur, the wonderful temple I\'ve ever seen. The weather is fine. We are now staying in a hotel. It\'s not far from Malioboro. We are treated will here. It has many excellent staff who serve the customers. We plan to go around Malioboro after the children take a short nap. We want to enjoy having \"lesehan\" there. It is a kind of a restaurant but we sit on the ground.\n\nMany kinds of local handicraft are sold along Malioboro street. Both domestic and foreign tourists are interested in them. I want to buy some as souvenirs. Don\'t worry, I\'ll also buy you the most interesting one.\n\nLove,\nDara   \n\nHow do the staff serve the customers of the hotel?\n',1,68,'4','Proudly','Badly','Interestingly','Nicely','','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2043,'','<p>The text gives us information about ....</p>\r\n',1,68,'4','<p>he wonderful Borobudur temple</p>\r\n','<p>The souvenirs to be bought.</p>\r\n','<p>Dara&#39;s last day in Jogja</p>\r\n','<p>d. comfortable hotel near Malioboro</p>\r\n','','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-28 06:00:20',NULL),(2044,NULL,'Who is the letter from?\n\n',1,68,'4',' Customers','The hotel staffs','Betty','Dara.','','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2045,NULL,'Read the following text to answer questions number 12-15\nUbud, 7th April 2007 \n\nDear Barbara, \nHi there. How are things with you? It\'s good to know that you are doing fine in business. Have you received my postcard?\n\nI am now sitting in my hotel room writing a letter to you about my wonderful holiday. I think this is the most wonderful holiday have I ever had. There are a lot of interesting tourist objects to visit, beautiful local art and craft, tasty traditional food, and much more. It\'s Thursday today. I can\'t believe this my last day. I wish I could spend more time here. I am certain I will stay longer on my next visit.\n\nI\'ll be home about 3 p.m. tomorrow if the flight is on time. On Monday I must go back to work. I can\'t wait to show my video to my class.\n\nOkay, that\'s all for now. Send my love to your children.\n\nBest wishes from,\nVivian\n\n\nThe letter tells us about ....\n\n',1,68,'4','Vivian\'s holiday in Bali','Barbara\'s letter','Vivian\'s favorite places',' Barbara\'s plan for Bali','','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2046,NULL,'On what day Vivian going to arrive home?\n\n',1,68,'4','Thursday\n','Friday','Saturday','Sunday','','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2047,NULL,'\"... the most wonderful holiday ...\" The underlined word has the same meaning with ....',1,68,'4','Usual\n','. Awesome',' Poor','Hateful','','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2048,NULL,'The letter shows that Vivian ....\n\n',1,68,'4','Has not eaten the day before','Bought all beautiful local art','Has tried the traditional food','Did not have nice holiday ','','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2049,NULL,'I love living in Australia ?. the weather.\n\n',1,68,'4','because','since','as','because of','','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2050,NULL,'The increase in the number of cans on the road has resulted ?. more and more traffic jams.\n\n',1,68,'4',' in','to',' at','for','','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2051,NULL,'?He got to work really, really late ?Cos he missed his train?. Which cause and effect word is ?Cos short for?\n',1,68,'4','due to','because','as','since','','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2052,NULL,'Keith lost his job due ?. cutbacks in the department.\n\n\n',1,68,'4',' for',' at','to',' by','','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2053,NULL,'\nThe increase in tropical storms in recent year has been ?. global warming.\n\n',1,68,'4',' put up with','put down to','set down to','put to','','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-03-27 21:43:49',NULL),(2054,NULL,' ?. being very rich, he never shows off.\n\n',1,68,'4','O