Gilang : Sure ...........</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rendy : Help me gather everybody. the teacher is coming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The proper expression to fill the blank above is ....</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','How can I help you?','How can you borrow my hand?','Why?','When can you help me?','Who can help you?','A',NULL,4,NULL,'2022-09-22 02:16:58',NULL),(5269,'','<p>Ika : You look so busy. ..........</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Prisca : No. Thank you. I can handle them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The suitable expression to complete the dialogue is ...</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','I will leave you alone','Would you like some help?','Do you want to hep me?','Sure, I would like to.','Yes, please.','B',NULL,4,NULL,'2022-09-22 02:17:55',NULL),(5270,'','<p>Marsyella : I heard there will be a concert tonight. Would you like to go with me?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siwi : I&#39;m afraid I can not.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Marsyella : Why I think you really love the band.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siwi : Yes. I do. But I have many works at home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Masyella : Let me help you, then.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siwi : ..................</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Marsyella : Never mind. That&#39;s what friend should do.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Would should Siwi say?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','I really appreciate your help.','I don\'t need your help','I am fine, thank you','I will go, too','Don\'t worry','A',NULL,4,NULL,'2022-09-22 02:19:22',NULL),(5271,'','<p>Yasri : Hello, Oliv. Where have you been?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Olivia : Hi Yasri. I just bought few kilograms of apples in the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yasri : ....................................</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The suitable respond to complete the dialogue is ......</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','I don\'t know','Why','Of course, that\'s very kind of you','I will help you','Good bye','C',NULL,4,NULL,'2022-09-22 02:20:25',NULL),(5272,'','<p>Naufal : ......our English class is very boring.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Florent : I think so. The teacher should use more English games to make it fun.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The suitable expression to complete the dialogue is ...</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','I agree','I