; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Daerah yang diarsir merupakan penyelesaian dari pertidaksamaan ....</p>\r\n',1,16,'1','<p>3y + x&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\geq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cgeq\" /> -3</p>\r\n','<p>3y + x&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\leq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleq\" />&nbsp;-3</p>\r\n','<p>3y + x&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\leq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleq\" />&nbsp; 3</p>\r\n','<p>3x + y&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\geq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cgeq\" /> -3</p>\r\n','<p>3y - x&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\leq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cleq\" />&nbsp;3</p>\r\n','A',NULL,145,'2022-11-17 01:56:33','2022-12-05 00:23:03',NULL),(8226,'PENILAIAN AKHIR SEKOLAH TAHUN AJARAN 2022/2023','<p>Galang mempunyai sebidang tanah yang luasnya <em>200 </em><em>m</em><em>2</em>, rencananya tanah tersebut akan dibuat lahan parkir mobil dan bus. Luas tempat parkir rata-rata yang dibutuhkan sebuah mobil 10 <em>m</em><em>2</em>&nbsp;dan sebuah bus 20 <em>m</em><em>2</em>, tempat parkir tersebut tidak dapat menampung lebih dari 12 mobil. Galang akan menentukan harga parkir setiap jamnya sebesar&nbsp; Rp. 8000&nbsp; untuk mobil dan Rp.15.000 untuk bus.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bentuk model matematika permasalahan diatas adalah ....</p>\r\n',1,16,'1','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/145_202211180140.jpg\" style=\"height:133px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/145_202211180139.jpg\" style=\"height:149px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/145_202211180141.jpg\" style=\"height:143px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/145_202211180142.jpg\" style=\"height:136px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/145_202211180143.jpg\" style=\"height:140px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n','B',NULL,145,'2022-11-17 01:58:28','2022-11-18 01:43:29',NULL),(8227,NULL,'In order to log on to the Internet, Sally __________ her user I.D.',1,9,'5','must enter',' has got to entering ',' have to enter ','enter','entering','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8228,NULL,'When a police officer asks to see your driver\'s license, you _____________ to him/her.',1,9,'5','must to show it','have got show it','have got to show it','show','show off','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8229,NULL,' \nIf you have a pet dog, you _____________ feed it every day or it will die!',1,9,'5','have got to',' has got to ',' have got ','have gotten','have go','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8230,NULL,' \nMr. Wu: Hi, Mark. Where\'s your dad?\nMark: Oh, he ______________ to work because there was an emergency.',1,9,'5','had got to go','had to go',' musted go ','gotten do','gotting','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8231,NULL,'Son: Mom, I don\'t want to clean my room. _________________ it right now?\nMother: Yes, right now.',1,9,'5','Have I to clean',' Do I have to clean ',' Do I must clean ','Must I clean ?','Clean I ?','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8232,NULL,'If Richard wants to become a professional musician, he ______________ every day.',1,9,'5','have to practice','has to practice','\nhaves to practice ','have been practice','has been to','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8233,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nJohan: Hello, Juned. Where have you been?\n\nJuned: Hi, Johan. I just bought few kilograms of apples in the market.\n\nJohan: Do you need some help to carry the apples?\n\nJuned: _______\n\n\nThe suitable respond to complete the dialogue is ?.\nanswer choices ',1,9,'5','\n\nI don?t know\n','\n\nOf course, that?s very kind of you\n','\n\nGood bye\n','\n\nI will help you\n','help you','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8234,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nRohim: You look so busy. _______\n\nMaryani: No, thank you. I can handle them.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the dialogue is ?.\nanswer choices ',1,9,'5','I will leave you alone','Do you want to help me?','Yes, please','Would you like some help?','I will help them','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8235,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nAndy: I heard there will be a concert tonight. Would you like to go with me?\n\nSarkam: I?m afraid I cannot.\n\nAndy: Why? I think you really love the band.\n\nSarkam: Yes, I do. But I have many works at home.\n\nAndy: Let me help you, then.\n\nSarkam: ___________\n\nAndy: Never mind. That?s what friend should do.\n\n\nWhat should Sam say?',1,9,'5','\n\nI really appreciate your help\n','\n\nI am fine, thank you\n','\n\nDon?t worry\n','I don?t need your help','I am good thank you','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8236,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nJubaedah: Good morning, Sir. Do you have science book about animal anatomy?\n\nShopkeeper: Of course, dear. We have the book that you want. ______ (4) to show the shelf?\n\nJubaedah: I am fine, Sir. I can find by myself. I have other books to find, too.\n\nShopkeeper: ________ (5). Take your time.\n\nJubaedah: Thank you, Sir.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the blank space number (4) is ?..',1,9,'5','\n\nI would like\n','\n\nDo not go\n','\n\nCan you\n','\n\nWould you like me\n','Would you know','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8237,NULL,'Jubaedah: Good morning, Sir. Do you have science book about animal anatomy?\n\nShopkeeper: Of course, dear. We have the book that you want. ______ (4) to show the shelf?\n\nJubaedah: I am fine, Sir. I can find by myself. I have other books to find, too.\n\nShopkeeper: ________ (5). Take your time.\n\nJubaedah: Thank you, Sir.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the blank space number (5) is ?..',1,9,'5','\n\nI am busy\n','\n\nThank you\n','\n\nThat?s okay\n','\n\nWill you go?\n','That s big no','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8238,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nRomlah : Sir, would you like me to close the window for you?\n\nMr. Ibrahim: Yes, please. It?s very cold inside.\n\n\nThe underlined sentence express:',1,9,'5','\n\nAsking help\n','\n\nOffering help\n','\n\nAccepting an offer\n','Refusing something','Accepting help','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8239,NULL,'Q. \n\nElla: Mom, do you need some help? You look so busy this morning.\n\nMom: Of course, dear.\n\nI need another pair of hands to wash the dish.\n\n\nThe underlined sentence expresses ?',1,9,'5','\n\nAccepting help\n','\n\nRefusing help\n','\n\nApologizing\n','\n\nLooking for something\n','Loving','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8240,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nBonet: Jay, will you join me to build a birdhouse?\n\nSonjaya: Sure, _______. I am really excited.\n\n\nComplete the dialogue above with right expression ?.',1,9,'5','\n\nI don?t want to.\n','\n\nI will\n','\n\nI have to go\n','\n\nI am busy today\n','I must ','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8241,NULL,'He ______________ to Hawaii many times.',1,9,'5','have been','went','has been','was going','gonna','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8242,NULL,'I _________________ to Oregon twice last year',1,9,'5','have been','has been','went','was going','not going','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8243,NULL,'The present perfect tense is made:',1,9,'5','have/has + past participle','had + participle','be + verb + -ing','have/has + past tense','is + am + are','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8244,NULL,'She _________________ ten pages already.',1,9,'5','has wrote','has written','writed','wrote','writing','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8245,NULL,'Steven ________________ seven movies so far this month.',1,9,'5','saw','will see','has seen','will have seen','will go','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL),(8246,NULL,'We have lived here ____________ 2008.',1,9,'5','for','since','in','on','at','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2022-11-17 02:01:23',NULL