 Sungai Penuh to Pelompek village by public transport. Then people climb and walk for another 4 km or for 2.5 hours. The lake is surrounded by steep forest slopes and seven mountains. The highest peak of Gunung Tujuh Lake is 1,950 m above sea level. The length of the lake is 4,5 km and the width is 3 km. It is a volcanic lake and the highest in Southeast Asia. The temperature around the lake is very cold. Besides waterfalls you can also find animals such as siamang. elephants and birds. Gunung Tujuh Lake is really beautiful with a spectacular scenery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What does the text mainly talk about?</p>\r\n',1,42,'2','<p>Amazing tourist resorts in Jambi</p>\r\n','<p>Gunung Tujuh Lake in Jambi</p>\r\n','<p>Steep forest slopes in Jambi</p>\r\n','<p>Waterfalls in Jambi</p>\r\n','<p>Jambi</p>\r\n','B',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-02-28 03:00:19',NULL),(8955,'','<p>Gunung Tujuh Lake is one of the many lakes in Kabupaten Kerinci in Jambi province. It is an amazing tourist place to visit. The location of Gunung Tujuh Lake is in Kecamatan Kayu Aro. It is about 50 km from Sungai Penuh to Pelompek village by public transport. Then people climb and walk for another 4 km or for 2.5 hours. The lake is surrounded by steep forest slopes and seven mountains. The highest peak of Gunung Tujuh Lake is 1,950 m above sea level. The length of the lake is 4,5 km and the width is 3 km. It is a volcanic lake and the highest in Southeast Asia. The temperature around the lake is very cold. Besides waterfalls you can also find animals such as siamang. elephants and birds. Gunung Tujuh Lake is really beautiful with a spectacular scenery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The main idea of the text is that..........</p>\r\n',1,42,'2','<p>Gunung Tujuh Lake is a beautiful tourist destination</p>\r\n','<p>The location of Gunung Tujuh Lake is di faculty to reach</p>\r\n','<p>Gunung Tujuh Lake is the only lake in Sumatra</p>\r\n','<p>Tourists from Southeast Asia visit this beautiful lake</p>\r\n','<p>The animals are more