o busy. _______\n\nMaryani: No, thank you. I can handle them.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the dialogue is ?.\nanswer choices ',1,9,'6','I will leave you alone','Do you want to help me?','Yes, please','Would you like some help?','Would you like some bet?','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-03-01 11:21:46',NULL),(9201,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nAndy: I heard there will be a concert tonight. Would you like to go with me?\n\nSarkam: I?m afraid I cannot.\n\nAndy: Why? I think you really love the band.\n\nSarkam: Yes, I do. But I have many works at home.\n\nAndy: Let me help you, then.\n\nSarkam: ___________\n\nAndy: Never mind. That?s what friend should do.\n\n\nWhat should Sam say?',1,9,'6','\n\nI really appreciate your help\n','\n\nI am fine, thank you\n','\n\nDon?t worry\n','I don?t need your help','I don?t need your money','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-03-01 11:21:46',NULL),(9202,NULL,'\nQ. \n\nJubaedah: Good morning, Sir. Do you have science book about animal anatomy?\n\nShopkeeper: Of course, dear. We have the book that you want. ______ (4) to show the shelf?\n\nJubaedah: I am fine, Sir. I can find by myself. I have other books to find, too.\n\nShopkeeper: ________ (5). Take your time.\n\nJubaedah: Thank you, Sir.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the blank space number (4) is ?..',1,9,'6','\n\nI would like\n','\n\nDo not go\n','\n\nCan you\n','\n\nWould you like me\n','\n\nWould you help me\n','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-03-01 11:21:46',NULL),(9203,NULL,'Jubaedah: Good morning, Sir. Do you have science book about animal anatomy?\n\nShopkeeper: Of course, dear. We have the book that you want. ______ (4) to show the shelf?\n\nJubaedah: I am fine, Sir. I can find by myself. I have other books to find, too.\n\nShopkeeper: ________ (5). Take your time.\n\nJubaedah: Thank you, Sir.\n\n\nThe suitable expression to complete the blank space number (5) is ?..',1,9,'6','\n\nI am busy\n','\n\nThank you\n','\n\nThat?s okay\n','\n\nWill you go?\n','\n\nCan you go?\n','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-03-