n','<p>A captain</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:02:41','2023-05-18 07:02:41',NULL),(10923,'','<p>She/he is responsible for establishing and maintaining positive customer relationships, handling guest needed in room process, and give satisfaction services</p>\r\n',1,42,'2','<p>Room Attendant</p>\r\n','<p>Marketing staff</p>\r\n','<p>Engineer</p>\r\n','<p>Security staff</p>\r\n','<p>Receptionist</p>\r\n','E',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:04:30','2023-05-18 07:04:30',NULL),(10924,'','<p>What is the best arrangement for the following procedure text?<br />\r\n1. Read over the service agreement and click the box saying that you agree to abide by the email system&#39;s rules. Once completed, click on the Submit or Enter button at the bottom of the screen.<br />\r\n2. Find where to sign up. Usually, there is a small link image or text that says &quot;register&quot; or &quot;sign up,&quot; although you may have to go to the login page to find this.<br />\r\n3. Visit a website that offers an email service. Usually are yahoo.com, google.com, and hotmail.com.<br />\r\n4. Follow all the instructions on the page, filling out all the needed details.<br />\r\n5. Email has been created. Continue on to import your contacts, message with friends, or write emails, plus much more.</p>\r\n',1,42,'2','<p>3 - 2 - 4 - 1 - 5</p>\r\n','<p>3 - 4 - 2 - 1 - 5</p>\r\n','<p>3 - 4 - 1 - 2 - 5</p>\r\n','<p>3 - 1 - 4 - 2 - 5</p>\r\n','<p>3 - 1 - 2 - 4 - 5</p>\r\n','A',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:06:37','2023-05-18 07:06:51',NULL),(10925,'','<p><em>Complete the following dialogue.</em><br />\r\nAlex: Hi, I&#39;ve been riding around for ten minutes. I&#39;m looking for an ATM. Can you show me where the ATM is?<br />\r\nPedestrian: . . . . . I&#39;m just getting off the bus. Maybe the guy over there knows.<br />\r\nAlex: Oh, ok. no problem. Have a good day.<br />\r\nPedestrian: You too.</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>Yes, please go straight to St. Carl Robinson street, then turn left to Queen street. The ATM is on your right hand side.</p>\r\n','<p>Sure, it&#39;s over there in front of the bank.</p>\r\n','<p>Leave me alone.</p>\r\n','<p>I&#39;m sorry, I&#39;m not living here.</p>\r\n','<p>I don&#39;t know</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:14:03','2023-05-18 07:14:03',NULL),(10926,'','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/135_202305180716.jpg\" style=\"height:463px; width:640px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Give the direction based on the route given on the map.</em><br />\r\nSomeone: Excuse me, can you tell me the way to Lin&#39;s Cafe?<br />\r\nYou: Yes, . . . . . . .</p>\r\n',1,42,'2','<p>Take Otista avenue and keep driving until you find the intersection of Otista avenue and Mustafa avenue. After that turn left to Mustafa avenue and go straight then turn left to Queen avenue. Lin&#39;s Cafe is next to elementary school.</p>\r\n','<p>Stay on Otista avenue then turn right to Ahmad avenue. Keep driving until the end ot the block. Lin&#39;s Cafe is on your right hand side.</p>\r\n','<p>Go straight on Otista avenue then turn right to Ibrahim avenue. Keep driving until you pass the town square, then turn left to Oreon avenue. Lin&#39;s Cafe is on the corner of the block.</p>\r\n','<p>Stay on Otista avenue until you find the intersection. Then turn left to Ibrahim avenue, keep driving and go through Misty avenue. Next turn right to Queen avenue. Lin&#39;s Cafe is next to church.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<p>Stay on Oreo avenue then turn right to Ahmad avenue. Keep driving until the end ot the block. Lin&#39;s Cafe is on your right hand side.</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:19:32','2023-05-18 07:19:32',NULL),(10927,'','<p><strong>SMK Pandawa Bali Global Abiansemal</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MEMO</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>To&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: All teachers and staff</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From : Principal</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Date&nbsp;: April 7th&nbsp;2021</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Re&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: Workshop</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please attend the workshop of New Normal Education that will be held on April 12th&nbsp;2021 at Aula. Considering the importance of the event, all teachers and staff must attend the workshop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Principal</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The memo is addressed to &hellip;.</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>All teachers only</p>\r\n','<p>All teachers and staff</p>\r\n','<p>Principal</p>\r\n','<p>All staff only</p>\r\n','<p>Student</p>\r\n','B',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:22:44','2023-05-18 07:22:57',NULL),(10928,'','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/135_202305180723.jpeg\" style=\"height:1027px; width:720px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>How many items menu are for the main course?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>4 items menu</p>\r\n','<p>6 items menu</p>\r\n','<p>8 items menu</p>\r\n','<p>10 items menu</p>\r\n','<p>12 items menu</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:25:01','2023-05-18 07:25:01',NULL),(10929,'','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/135_202305180726.PNG\" style=\"height:452px; width:760px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>How many lessons are given to the students based on the schedule above?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>15 lessons</p>\r\n','<p>16 lessons</p>\r\n','<p>17 lessons</p>\r\n','<p>18 lessons</p>\r\n','<p>19 lessons</p>\r\n','A',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:28:02','2023-05-18 07:28:02',NULL),(10930,'','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/135_202305180728.jpg\" style=\"height:362px; width:250px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>What does the sign mean?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>We may smoke in that area</p>\r\n','<p>We are allowed to smoke in that area</p>\r\n','<p>Smoking is not forbidden in that are</p>\r\n','<p>We are not allowed to smoke in that are</p>\r\n','<p>We can smoke here</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,'2023-05-18 07:29:49','2023-05-18 07:29:49',NULL),(10931,'','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://gtk.smkpandawabaliglobal.sch.id/./asset/soals/135_202305180731.jpg\" style=\"height:369px; width:251px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>