Bromo mountain two days ago?</p>\r\n','<p>. Were Kintan and I drawing a view of Bromo mountain two days ago?</p>\r\n','<p>Was Kintan and I drawing a view of Bromo mountain two days ago?</p>\r\n','D',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 07:54:37',NULL),(10948,'','<p>Last holiday my students and I went to Yogyakarta. We stayed at Morison Hotel which is not a long way from Malioboro. On Friday, we went to the sanctuaries in Prambanan. There are three significant sanctuaries, the Brahmana, Siwa, and Wisnu. They are truly stunning. We went by just Brahmana and Syiwa sanctuaries, on the grounds that Wisnu sanctuary is being remodeled. On Saturday morning we went to Yogya Kraton. We spent around two hours there. We were fortunate on the grounds that a brilliant and amicable aide drove us. At that point, we proceeded with our adventure to Borobudur. We touched base there at four p.m. At 6 p.m. we heard the declaration that the Borobudur entryway would be closed. In the evening we left Yogyakarta by bus.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The content above basically talks about .......</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>The writer&#39;s trip to Yogyakarta.</p>\r\n','<p>The writer&#39;s first visit to Prambanan.</p>\r\n','<p>The writer&#39;s impression of the guide.</p>\r\n','<p>he writer&#39;s experience at Yogya Kraton.</p>\r\n','<p>The writer&#39;s trip to Java</p>\r\n','A',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 07:55:01',NULL),(10949,'','<p>A Trip to the Zoo Yesterday my family and I went to the zoo to see the elephant. When we got to the zoo, we went to the shop to buy some food to give to the animals. After getting the food, we went to the nocturnal house where we saw birds and reptiles which only come out at night. Before having lunch, we went for a ride on the elephant. It was a thrill to ride it. Dad fell off when he let go of the rope, but he was ok. During lunch, we fed some birds in the park. In the afternoon we saw the animals being fed. When we returned home, we were very tired but happy. It was because we had so many fun activities at many places at the zoo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What happened to the writer&#39;s dad when he rode an elephant?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>He felt a thrill</p>\r\n','<p>He felt fun</p>\r\n','<p>He fell off</p>\r\n','<p>He failed</p>\r\n','<p>He didn?t fell</p>\r\n','C',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 07:55:17',NULL),(10950,'','<p>Last holiday my students and I went to Yogyakarta. We stayed at Morison Hotel which is not a long way from Malioboro. On Friday, we went to the sanctuaries in Prambanan. There are three significant sanctuaries, the Brahmana, Siwa, and Wisnu. They are truly stunning. We went by just Brahmana and Syiwa sanctuaries, on the grounds that Wisnu sanctuary is being remodeled. On Saturday morning we went to Yogya Kraton. We spent around two hours there. We were fortunate on the grounds that a brilliant and amicable aide drove us. At that point, we proceeded with our adventure to Borobudur. We touched base there at four p.m. At 6 p.m. we heard the declaration that the Borobudur entryway would be closed. In the evening we left Yogyakarta by bus.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What are the big temples in Prambanan?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>angkor wat, syiwa, and sudra temples</p>\r\n','<p>paria, brahmana, and temples</p>\r\n','<p>brahmana, syiwa, and wisnu temples</p>\r\n','<p>wisnu, syiwa, and borobudur temples</p>\r\n','<p>borobudur, syiwa, and brahmana temples</p>\r\n','C',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 07:55:49',NULL),(10951,'','<p>Last holiday my students and I went to Yogyakarta. We stayed at Morison Hotel which is not a long way from Malioboro. On Friday, we went to the sanctuaries in Prambanan. There are three significant sanctuaries, the Brahmana, Siwa, and Wisnu. They are truly stunning. We went by just Brahmana and Syiwa sanctuaries, on the grounds that Wisnu sanctuary is being remodeled. On Saturday morning we went to Yogya Kraton. We spent around two hours there. We were fortunate on the grounds that a brilliant and amicable aide drove us. At that point, we proceeded with our adventure to Borobudur. We touched base there at four p.m. At 6 p.m. we heard the declaration that the Borobudur entryway would be closed. In the evening we left Yogyakarta by bus.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When did they go home?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>On Saturday morning</p>\r\n','<p>On Friday evening</p>\r\n','<p>On Thursday evening</p>\r\n','<p>On Friday afternoon</p>\r\n','<p>On Saturday evening</p>\r\n','B',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:07:42',NULL),(10953,'','<p>Waitress : Can I start off with anything to drink?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : Yes, may I have some water?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : Sure, would you like any appetizers today?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : May I get an order of barbeque wings?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : No problem, can I get you anything else?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : No, thank you, that&#39;s be all for now Waitress : Let me know when you&#39;re ready to order your food</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : I&#39;m ready Waitress : What can I get up?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : Will that be all?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : Yes, that&#39;s it</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What drink does Anne order?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>Coke</p>\r\n','<p>Lemonade</p>\r\n','<p>Water</p>\r\n','<p>Barbeque wings</p>\r\n','<p>Fettuccini</p>\r\n','C',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:06:22',NULL),(10954,'','<p>Waitress : Can I start off with anything to drink?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : Yes, may I have some water?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : Sure, would you like any appetizers today?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : May I get an order of barbeque wings?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : No problem, can I get you anything else?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : No, thank you, that&#39;s be all for now</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : Let me know when you&#39;re ready to order your food</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : I&#39;m ready Waitress : What can I get up?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anne : Will that be all?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Waitress : Yes, that&#39;s it The offer, <strong>can I start you off with anything to drink?</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&quot;<strong>can I start you off with anything to drink&quot;&nbsp;</strong>can best replaced with......</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>May I get you anything to drink?</p>\r\n','<p>May I get a glass lemonade?</p>\r\n','<p>Would you like an appetizer?</p>\r\n','<p>May I get an order of barbeque wings?</p>\r\n','<p>Sure, would you like anything else?</p>\r\n','A',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:05:18',NULL),(10955,'','<p>What is setting?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>The context and environment of a story</p>\r\n','<p>An imaginary person presented in a fiction</p>\r\n','<p>A prominent attribute or aspect of something</p>\r\n','<p>The unifying idea of a story</p>\r\n','<p>The story being told</p>\r\n','E',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:01:46',NULL),(10956,'','<p>There once lived a group of monkeys in a jungle. One day, they decided to fast together. Before fasting, the monkey prepares many delicious yellow bananas as food to break the fast. Them, they prayed together to star the fast. The chief&#39;s wife suggested that the bananas be distributed beforehand to save the time. The chief agreed and appointed a monkey to distributed the bananas equally among all the monkeys. After for some time fasting, a young monkey fasted suggested to peel one banana ready to eat to save time. The chief agreed, so each monkey peeled a banana and kept it ready. With a peeled banana ready in front of them, the monkeys started getting impatient. Then, a baby monkey asked if he could put a banana in his mouth. He promised not to eat it, just to save time latter. The thought, it was a good idea, so he instructed everyone to put a banana in their mouths, but under no circumstances should they eat. One by one the monkeys put the bananas in their mouths. Shortly afterwards, all of the bananas had disappeared down their stomachs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So much a day of fasting! That day, the monkey prepared to.......</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>Live that day normally</p>\r\n','<p>Collect bananas together</p>\r\n','<p>Fast together</p>\r\n','<p>Gather and chant a prayer</p>\r\n','<p>Discuss what to do that day</p>\r\n','C',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:01:15',NULL),(10957,'','<p>Arrange the sentences below into a correct narrative!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(1) At the further of the wood was another pretty cottage</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(2) There was once a sweet maid who lived in a pretty cottage</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(3) She gave her a red clock with a hood which she always wears</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(4) Where grandmother lived in</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(5) Everybody loved this little girl, her grandmother loved her most of all</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(6) So, people called her Red Riding Hood</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The best arrangement is.......</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>2-1-3-4-5-6</p>\r\n','<p>2-3-1-4-5-6</p>\r\n','<p>1-2-3-4-5-6</p>\r\n','<p>1-2-4-3-5-6</p>\r\n','<p>2-1-4-5-3-6</p>\r\n','E',NULL,135,NULL,'2023-05-18 08:00:25',NULL),(10958,'','<p>A fox fell into a well and couldn&#39;t get out. By and by a thirsty goat came along. Seeing the fox in the well it asked if the water was good. &quot;Good&quot;, said the fox. &quot;It&#39;s the best water I&#39;ve tasted in all my life. Come down and try it yourself. &quot;The goat thought of nothing but how thirsty he was. So, he jumped into the well. When he had drunk enough, he looked around but there was no way to get out. Then the fox said, &quot;I have a good idea. You stand on your hind legs and put your forelegs against the side of the well. Then I&#39;ll climb on your back, from there I&#39;ll step on your horns, and I can get out. And when I&#39;m out I&#39;ll help you out of the well. &quot;The goat did as he was asked and the fox got on his back and so out of the well. Then he coolly walked away. The goat called out loudly after him out. The fox merely turned to him and said, &quot;If you only have as much sense in your head as you have hairs in your beard you wouldn&#39;t have jumped into the well without making sure that you could get out again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is the type of the previous text?</p>\r\n',1,9,'2','<p>Myth</p>\r\n','<p>Play</p>\r\n','<p>Legend</p>\