 idea!','I\'m not really into hiking.','I might consider it.','I have other plans.','Absolutely not.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14548,NULL,'Can I offer you some assistance with your homework?',1,9,'3','Yes, please, I could use some help.','I think I can manage on my own.','Maybe later, I\'ll let you know.','I don\'t need any help.','I\'d rather not, thanks.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14549,NULL,'Would you be interested in taking part in the charity event next month?\n',1,9,'3',' I\'m not interested at all.',' I\'ll think about it.','I\'m not sure if I can commit.',' Count me in!','I won\'t participate.','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14550,NULL,'How about we study together for the upcoming exam?\n',1,9,'3','I prefer to study alone.','That sounds like a good plan.','Maybe, I\'ll see if I have time.',' I don\'t need help with studying.','I\'d rather not.','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14551,NULL,'Do you want to go shopping with me this afternoon?\n\n',1,9,'3',' I\'m not really in the mood for shopping.','I might consider it.','Yes, I\'d love to.','I have other plans.','No, thanks.','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14552,NULL,'Can I suggest a solution to your problem?\n',1,9,'3',' Please, go ahead.','I think I can figure it out on my own.','Maybe later, I\'ll ask if needed.',' I don\'t need your help.','I\'d rather not.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14553,NULL,'How about trying the new restaurant downtown this weekend?\n',1,9,'3','Absolutely not.','I don\'t want to try new restaurants.',' I might be busy.','. I prefer to stick to familiar places.','That sounds like a great idea!','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-09-17 02:53:14',NULL),(14554,NULL,'Would you like me to proofread your essay before you submit it?\n',1,9,'3','I think my essay is fine as it is.','Yes, please, I could use some help.','Maybe later, I\'ll let you know.',' I don\'t need any help.','I\'d rather not, thanks.