ant downtown this weekend?\n',1,9,'3','Absolutely not.','I don\'t want to try new restaurants.',' I might be busy.',' I prefer to stick to familiar places.','That sounds like a great idea!','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17740,NULL,'Would you like me to proofread your essay before you submit it?\n',1,9,'3','I think my essay is fine as it is.','Yes, please, I could use some help.','Maybe later, I\'ll let you know.',' I don\'t need any help.','I\'d rather not, thanks.','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17741,NULL,'Can I offer you a ride home after the party?\n',1,9,'3','I have my own transportation.','Maybe, I\'ll see if I need a ride later.','That would be really helpful, thanks!','I\'d rather not, thanks.',' I don\'t need a ride.','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17742,NULL,'How about we go for a swim at the beach tomorrow?\n',1,9,'3','That sounds like a great idea!','I\'m not a fan of swimming.','I might consider it.','I have other plans.','Absolutely not.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17743,NULL,'Would you like to team up for the group project?\n',1,9,'3',' I won\'t join your group.',' I don\'t want to be in a group.',' I\'ll think about it.','I prefer to work alone.','Yes, I\'m in!','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17744,NULL,'Can I suggest a book for you to read?\n',1,9,'3','I have enough books to read for now.',' Please do, I\'m always looking for recommendations.','Maybe later, I\'ll check it out.',' I\'m not interested in reading.','I\'d rather not.','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17745,NULL,'How about we grab some coffee and catch up?\n\n',1,9,'3','That sounds like a great plan!','I might be busy.','I don\'t drink coffee.',' I\'m not interested in catching up.','No, thanks.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17746,NULL,'What is the main purpose of an invitation letter?',1,9,'3','To provide weather updates\n',' To ask for help',' To invite someone to an event','To share the latest news','To seek advice','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17747,NULL,' Who typically sends an invitation letter?',1,9,'3','Close friends\n',' Strangers','Online stores',' Authorities','Lawyers','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17748,NULL,'When should you include information about the date and time of the event in the invitation letter?',1,9,'3','Not necessary\n','Before or after the event','After the event','In the middle of the letter','At the end of the letter','E',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17749,NULL,'Which of the following is NOT a common element of an invitation letter?',1,9,'3','RSVP information','Dress code','Venue details','Personal grievances','Contact information','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17750,NULL,'What is the purpose of mentioning an RSVP in an invitation letter?',1,9,'3',' To include a joke\n','To request a response','To share a recipe','To express gratitude','To send a gift','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17751,NULL,'Which phrase is often used in the closing of an invitation letter?',1,9,'3',' \"Let\'s catch up soon.\"\n','\"I hope you\'re doing well.\"','\"I need a favor.\"','\"I\'m too busy.\"',' \"Please don\'t come.\"','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17752,NULL,'What is the appropriate way to inform guests about the dress code for an event in an invitation letter?',1,9,'3',' Be vague and mysterious\n','Use acronyms and abbreviations','Provide clear and specific instructions','Don\'t mention it at all',' Send a separate email about it','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17753,NULL,'What is the purpose of mentioning the purpose of the event in an invitation letter?',1,9,'3',' To confuse the guests\n','To make the letter longer','To provide a history lesson',' To inform guests about the event\'s significance','To tell a joke','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17754,NULL,'What should you include in the introduction of an invitation letter?',1,9,'3','Your daily schedule\n','Your favorite book','Your life story',' A warm greeting and the reason for the invitation','A list of demands','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17755,NULL,'What is the purpose of mentioning the contact information in an invitation letter?',1,9,'3','To test the guests\' memory','To confuse the guests','To provide a backup plan in case of changes','To share a secret','To make the letter look longer','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17756,NULL,'What is the primary purpose of a personal letter?',1,9,'3','To provide weather updates\n\n\n','To request information','To promote a product','To communicate personal thoughts and feelings','To share breaking news','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17757,NULL,'What is the common way to start a personal letter?',1,9,'3',' \"To whom it may concern,\"','\"Dear Sir/Madam,\"','\"Dear [Recipient\'s Name],\"',' \"Hi, there!\"','\"Please buy my products.\"','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17758,NULL,'What should be included in the closing of a personal letter?',1,9,'3','A request for money\n\n\n\n',' A formal expression of gratitude or affection',' A list of complaints','An advertisement for a product','e. A joke','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17759,NULL,'What is the purpose of the body of a personal letter?',1,9,'3',' To criticize the recipient',' To provide a detailed biography','To share irrelevant information','To convey the main message or content',' To discuss the weather','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17760,NULL,'Which of the following is NOT a common element of a personal letter?\n\n\n\n\n',1,9,'3','Date','Recipient\'s name and address','Complaints about the weather',' Greeting',' Signature','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17761,NULL,'What is the purpose of mentioning your address in a personal letter?',1,9,'3','To test the recipient\'s memory\n','To share your favorite recipes','To provide a return address for the recipient','To criticize the recipient',' To make the letter look longer','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17762,NULL,'Can I suggest a solution to your problem?\n',1,9,'3',' Please, go ahead.','I think I can figure it out on my own.','Maybe later, I\'ll ask if needed.',' I don\'t need your help.','I\'d rather not.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17763,NULL,'How about trying the new restaurant downtown this weekend?\n',1,9,'3','Absolutely not.','I don\'t want to try new restaurants.',' I might be busy.',' I prefer to stick to familiar places.','That sounds like a great idea!','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17764,NULL,'Would you like me to proofread your essay before you submit it?\n',1,9,'3','I think my essay is fine as it is.','Yes, please, I could use some help.','Maybe later, I\'ll let you know.',' I don\'t need any help.','I\'d rather not, thanks.','B',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17765,NULL,'Can I offer you a ride home after the party?\n',1,9,'3','I have my own transportation.','Maybe, I\'ll see if I need a ride later.','That would be really helpful, thanks!','I\'d rather not, thanks.',' I don\'t need a ride.','C',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17766,NULL,'How about we go for a swim at the beach tomorrow?\n',1,9,'3','That sounds like a great idea!','I\'m not a fan of swimming.','I might consider it.','I have other plans.','Absolutely not.','A',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17767,NULL,'Would you like to team up for the group project?\n',1,9,'3',' I won\'t join your group.',' I don\'t want to be in a group.',' I\'ll think about it.','I prefer to work alone.','Yes, I\'m in!','D',NULL,28,NULL,'2023-11-22 11:06:55',NULL),(17768,NULL,'Can I suggest a book for you to read?\n',1,9,'3','I have enough books to read for now.',' Please do, I\'m always looking for recommendations.','Maybe later, I\'ll check it out.',' I\'m not interested in reading.','I\'d rather