 days. I think this caption is good and has a deep message.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Yeah, but this caption is not interesting because there is no picture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : You&rsquo;re right. What do you think about this friendship caption?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Awesome! The picture and the words are interesting and it has a good message. You can use our picture when sitting on the bench at the park, captured from the behind</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : Wonderful! Thank you for your suggestions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What are the speakers doing?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','<p>They are doing their assignment</p>\r\n','<p>They are discussing Zaidan&rsquo;s assignment to make a caption</p>\r\n','<p>They are searching or captions in the internet for their wall magazine</p>\r\n','<p>They are taking pictures at the park for captions</p>\r\n','<p>They are writing a caption about spirit to start days</p>\r\n','B',NULL,4,'2023-11-22 11:30:14','2023-11-22 11:30:14',NULL),(17778,'PAS','<p>Zaidan : I have a task to make a caption, but I am confused about what to write. Do you have any idea?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Why don&rsquo;t you search in the internet? There are good captions about nature, life or motivation as your inspiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : That&rsquo;s good idea. Let&rsquo;s search for them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Look, this nature caption is very good and the words are well arranged. I really recommend it for your caption.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : You are right, I don&rsquo;t have pictures about nature. Anyway, look at this caption! It&rsquo;s about the spirit to start days. I think this caption is good and has a deep message.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Yeah, but this caption is not interesting because there is no picture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : You&rsquo;re right. What do you think about this friendship caption?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Awesome! The picture and the words are interesting and it has a good message. You can use our picture when sitting on the bench at the park, captured from the behind</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : Wonderful! Thank you for your suggestions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What do they call a good caption?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','<p>It is contemporary</p>\r\n','<p>It should be written by a popular person</p>\r\n','<p>It shows a clear picture without words</p>\r\n','<p>It contains a good message, an interesting picture and meaningful words</p>\r\n','<p>It contains full-length sentences with simple pictures</p>\r\n','D',NULL,4,'2023-11-22 11:31:40','2023-11-22 11:31:40',NULL),(17779,'PAS','<p>Zaidan : I have a task to make a caption, but I am confused about what to write. Do you have any idea?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Why don&rsquo;t you search in the internet? There are good captions about nature, life or motivation as your inspiration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : That&rsquo;s good idea. Let&rsquo;s search for them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Look, this nature caption is very good and the words are well arranged. I really recommend it for your caption.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : You are right, I don&rsquo;t have pictures about nature. Anyway, look at this caption! It&rsquo;s about the spirit to start days. I think this caption is good and has a deep message.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Yeah, but this caption is not interesting because there is no picture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : You&rsquo;re right. What do you think about this friendship caption?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Syaiful : Awesome! The picture and the words are interesting and it has a good message. You can use our picture when sitting on the bench at the park, captured from the behind</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zaidan : Wonderful! Thank you for your suggestions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What caption will Zaidan make?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','<p>Environment</p>\r\n','<p>Spirit of life</p>\r\n','<p>Friendship</p>\r\n','<p>Nature</p>\r\n','<p>Motivation</p>\r\n','C',NULL,4,'2023-11-22 11:32:57','2023-11-22 11:32:57',NULL),(17780,'PAS','<p>Friends give us the courage to lift the darkness in our heart</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Give us light to keep moving,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Show us the amazing world</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And make our lives cheerful</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is the message of the above caption?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','<p>It shows the beauty of the word</p>\r\n','<p>It persuades the readers to be brave</p>\r\n','<p>It shows the value of friends</p>\r\n','<p>It motivates the readers to do better</p>\r\n','<p>It shows how important our lives are</p>\r\n','C',NULL,4,'2023-11-22 11:36:28','2023-11-22 11:36:28',NULL),(17781,'PAS','<p>Friends give us the courage to lift the darkness in our heart</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Give us light to keep moving,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Show us the amazing world</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And make our lives cheerful</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;&hellip;. Make our lives <strong>cheerful</strong>.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is the opposite meaning of the bold word?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','<p>Jolly</p>\r\n','<p>Woeful</p>\r\n','<p>Cozy</p>\r\n','<p>Lithe</p>\r\n','<p>Shrill</p>\r\n','B',NULL,4,'2023-11-22 11:40:15','2023-11-22 11:40:15',NULL),(17782,NULL,'Mendanai usaha dengan biaya sendiri disebut?.',1,161,'1','bootstrapping','venture caplitalist','angel investor','external fund','penggalangan dana','A',NULL,29,NULL,'2023-11-22 23:52:13',NULL),(17783,NULL,'Dana investasi kurang dari 1 juta USD merupakan ciri-ciri dari?.',1,161,'1','reksadana','angel investor','venture capitalist','bootstrapping','entrepreneur','B',NULL,29,NULL,'2023-11-22 23:52:13',NULL),(17784,NULL,'Menganalisa perkembangan usaha yang kemudian akan ditindaklanjuti merupakan fase?.',1,161,'1','memamfaatkan peluang','memunculkan ide','mempertahankan usaha','mengembamngkan usaha','mengambil alih usaha','B',NULL,29,NULL,'2023-11-22 23:52:13',NULL),(17785,NULL,'Tujuan dari pengusaha usaha rintisan adalah?..',1,161,'1','usahanya dapat digunakan untuk bertahan hidup','usahanya mampu mengubah wajah dunia','usahanya tidak akan sia-sia','usahanya akan ditanggung dengan dana sendiri','menumpuk pundi-pundi uang','B',NULL,29,NULL,'2023-11-22 23:52:13',NULL),(17786,NULL,'Pelajari daftar berikut 