 the help of a stopwatch. A photographer was also present. He took the photograph of the boys who stood first. There were many other races like 220 meter race, half mile race and one mile race.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was very cool and exciting. There were so many crowds in this event. Parents, teachers, and students were enthusiast to follow the event. The event finished at 4.00 p.m. in the afternoon. After that, I went home and took a rest.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The correct patern of hold is &hellip;</p>',1,53,'1','<p>hold</p>','<p>holds</p>','<p>holded</p>','<p>held</p>','<p>holding</p>','e',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 00:00:09','2025-09-27 00:00:09',NULL),(22192,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Last January, we celebrated the Annual Sports Day. The event is (hold) ... every year in January. We were so excited to participate on the event. We even (prepare) ... ourselves a week before for it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Preparations for the celebration of the sports day were made much in advance. There was a big gathering on that day in our school. The students having capability in sport games were given prizes by the chief guest. The parents of the students (8) ... also invited to attend the sports. This year our annual sports day was celebrated on the 10th of January. The Director of Education had kindly agreed to preside over the function. The sports day started at 9.00 a.m. with a memorable and colorful ceremony. First of all the chief guest unfurled the flag. After this, there (9) ... a march past by the students in their beautiful smart dresses. After the march past the chief guest declared to open the sports meet. First of all, the 100 meter race was organized. The signal for starting it was a gunshot. One teacher was noting the time with the help of a stopwatch. A photographer was also present. He took the photograph of the boys who stood first. There were many other races like 220 meter race, half mile race and one mile race.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The event was very cool and exciting.