nce in the sport. Known for his incredible speed and strategic racing style, he has claimed multiple world championships, showcasing his talent on various tracks around the globe. His ability to read races and make split-second decisions sets him apart from other riders. Fans admire not only his skills but also his sportsmanship and humility, making him a beloved figure both on and off the track.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Beyond his achievements, Rossi&#39;s passion for racing is evident in his interactions with fans. He often takes the time to sign autographs and pose for photos, showing his appreciation for the support he receives. This connection with his audience has earned him a loyal following, further solidifying his status as one of the greatest athletes in motorsport history.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What impact has Rossi had on his fans and followers?</p>',1,53,'1','<p>He has lost many fans due to his controversial behavior.</p>','<p>He has earned a loyal following and admiration for his sportsmanship.</p>','<p>He has become less popular over the years.</p>','<p>He is known for avoiding fan interactions.</p>','<p>He is primarily recognized for his wealth.</p>','b',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 01:50:14','2025-09-27 01:50:14',NULL),(22203,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>I want to be a great athlete. Therefore, I get up early and .... my schedule tightly.</p>',1,53,'1','<p>Take</p>','<p>Give</p>','<p>Miss</p>','<p>Hold</p>','<p>Arrange</p>','d',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 01:51:37','2025-09-27 01:51:37',NULL),(22204,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Hello, allow me to introduce myself. My name is Andre Detrio. You can call me Andre. I would like to tell you about my football experience. It was at my Junior High School time. As I knew, when I was at eight grades, I followed the football extracurricular. I had to practice how to be a good soccer player every Friday and Sunday. We practiced it in our school yard after class. My coach was Mr. Alex. He was so kind and funny. He told us how to kick the ball, blocked the ball, and passed the ball.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every letter about soccer champion, he asked and guided the students to follow. Winning or failing champion was not the priorities according to him. The most important for us was that we could know the real competition with another team from another school. He was so discipline. If one of his students came late, he punished them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Talking about my football experience, there was a football competition in my school. He announced to all and asked us to practice hard. He promised if we got the first winner, we would go to the beach. We were guided 2 weeks for training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition was scheduled in the beginning of August. We were so nervous and along the competition we faced many teams. We scored many goals. At the end of the competition, the master ceremony announced that our team was the first winner. He asked the captain of our team to come to the stage for the trophy. We were so happy, we yelled and laughed happily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The coach celebrated us and gave us the holiday to the beach on Sunday. That moment is my unforgettable football experience; I followed the football extracurricular in Senior High School too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At what age did Andre participate in football extracurricular activities?</p>',1,53,'1','<p>8 years old</p>','<p>10 years old</p>','<p>13 years old</p>','<p>20 years old</p>','<p>18 years old</p>','c',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 01:56:18','2025-09-27 01:56:18',NULL),(22205,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Hello, allow me to introduce myself. My name is Andre Detrio. You can call me Andre. I would like to tell you about my football experience. It was at my Junior High School time. As I knew, when I was at eight grades, I followed the football extracurricular. I had to practice how to be a good soccer player every Friday and Sunday. We practiced it in our school yard after class. My coach was Mr. Alex. He was so kind and funny. He told us how to kick the ball, blocked the ball, and passed the ball.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every letter about soccer champion, he asked and guided the students to follow. Winning or failing champion was not the priorities according to him. The most important for us was that we could know the real competition with another team from another school. He was so discipline. If one of his students came late, he punished them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Talking about my football experience, there was a football competition in my school. He announced to all and asked us to practice hard. He promised if we got the first winner, we would go to the beach. We were guided 2 weeks for training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition was scheduled in the beginning of August. We were so nervous and along the competition we faced many teams. We scored many goals. At the end of the competition, the master ceremony announced that our team was the first winner. He asked the captain of our team to come to the stage for the trophy. We were so happy, we yelled and laughed happily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The coach celebrated us and gave us the holiday to the beach on Sunday. That moment is my unforgettable football experience; I followed the football extracurricular in Senior High School too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What made Andre&#39;s football experience unforgettable?</p>',1,53,'1','<p>Winning many championships</p>','<p>Scoring numerous goals</p>','<p>Following football extracurricular in Senior High School</p>','<p>Going to the beach after winning a competition</p>','<p>Mr. Alex&#39;s discipline</p>','d',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 01:58:28','2025-09-27 01:58:28',NULL),(22206,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Hello, allow me to introduce myself. My name is Andre Detrio. You can call me Andre. I would like to tell you about my football experience. It was at my Junior High School time. As I knew, when I was at eight grades, I followed the football extracurricular. I had to practice how to be a good soccer player every Friday and Sunday. We practiced it in our school yard after class. My coach was Mr. Alex. He was so kind and funny. He told us how to kick the ball, blocked the ball, and passed the ball.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every letter about soccer champion, he asked and guided the students to follow. Winning or failing champion was not the priorities according to him. The most important for us was that we could know the real competition with another team from another school. He was so discipline. If one of his students came late, he punished them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Talking about my football experience, there was a football competition in my school. He announced to all and asked us to practice hard. He promised if we got the first winner, we would go to the beach. We were guided 2 weeks for training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition was scheduled in the beginning of August. We were so nervous and along the competition we faced many teams. We scored many goals. At the end of the competition, the master ceremony announced that our team was the first winner. He asked the captain of our team to come to the stage for the trophy. We were so happy, we yelled and laughed happily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The coach celebrated us and gave us the holiday to the beach on Sunday. That moment is my unforgettable football experience; I followed the football extracurricular in Senior High School too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Based on the text, Mr. Alex prioritizes the football extracurricular activities by ....</p>',1,53,'1','<p>focusing on winning championships</p>','<p>emphasizing the importance of discipline</p>','<p>encouraging students to come late for punishment</p>','<p>making the beach trip the top priority</p>','<p>ignoring the concept of winning or failing championships</p>','b',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 02:00:45','2025-09-27 02:00:45',NULL),(22207,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Hello, allow me to introduce myself. My name is Andre Detrio. You can call me Andre. I would like to tell you about my football experience. It was at my Junior High School time. As I knew, when I was at eight grades, I followed the football extracurricular. I had to practice how to be a good soccer player every Friday and Sunday. We practiced it in our school yard after class. My coach was Mr. Alex. He was so kind and funny. He told us how to kick the ball, blocked the ball, and passed the ball.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every letter about soccer champion, he asked and guided the students to follow. Winning or failing champion was not the priorities according to him. The most important for us was that we could know the real competition with another team from another school. He was so discipline. If one of his students came late, he punished them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Talking about my football experience, there was a football competition in my school. He announced to all and asked us to practice hard. He promised if we got the first winner, we would go to the beach. We were guided 2 weeks for training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition was scheduled in the beginning of August. We were so nervous and along the competition we faced many teams. We scored many goals. At the end of the competition, the master ceremony announced that our team was the first winner. He asked the captain of our team to come to the stage for the trophy. We were so happy, we yelled and laughed happily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The coach celebrated us and gave us the holiday to the beach on Sunday. That moment is my unforgettable football experience; I followed the football extracurricular in Senior High School too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Alex demonstrates discipline in the football extracurricular activities by ...</p>',1,53,'1','<p>punishing students who came late</p>','<p>ignoring punctuality</p>','<p>encouraging students to be late</p>','<p>allowing students to skip training</p>','<p>disregarding the importance of discipline</p>','a',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 02:04:49','2025-09-27 02:04:49',NULL),(22208,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Hello, allow me to introduce myself. My name is Andre Detrio. You can call me Andre. I would like to tell you about my football experience. It was at my Junior High School time. As I knew, when I was at eight grades, I followed the football extracurricular. I had to practice how to be a good soccer player every Friday and Sunday. We practiced it in our school yard after class. My coach was Mr. Alex. He was so kind and funny. He told us how to kick the ball, blocked the ball, and passed the ball.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every letter about soccer champion, he asked and guided the students to follow. Winning or failing champion was not the priorities according to him. The most important for us was that we could know the real competition with another team from another school. He was so discipline. If one of his students came late, he punished them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Talking about my football experience, there was a football competition in my school. He announced to all and asked us to practice hard. He promised if we got the first winner, we would go to the beach. We were guided 2 weeks for training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The competition was scheduled in the beginning of August. We were so nervous and along the competition we faced many teams. We scored many goals. At the end of the competition, the master ceremony announced that our team was the first winner. He asked the captain of our team to come to the stage for the trophy. We were so happy, we yelled and laughed happily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The coach celebrated us and gave us the holiday to the beach on Sunday. That moment is my unforgettable football experience; I followed the football extracurricular in Senior High School too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How did the football competition experience impact Andre and his teammates according to the text?</p>',1,53,'1','<p>It increased their focus on winning championships.</p>','<p>It created an unforgettable and joyous memory.</p>','<p>It made the beach trip the most memorable aspect.</p>','<p>It emphasized the importance of Mr. Alex&#39;s discipline.</p>','<p>It discouraged them from participating in future competitions.</p>','c',NULL,4,'2025-09-27 02:11:22','2025-09-27 02:11:22',NULL),(22209,NULL,'Seorang desainer grafis menerima brief dari klien untuk membuat logo. Bagian brief yang paling penting untuk dipelajari pertama kali adalah?',1,268,'3','Anggaran proyek','Batasan waktu','Nama dan visi perusahaan','Referensi desain','Daftar kompetitor','C',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22210,NULL,'Pada sebuah poster, ada sebuah tulisan yang sengaja dibuat lebih tebal, lebih besar, dan berwarna merah untuk menarik perhatian. Prinsip desain yang diterapkan adalah?',1,268,'3','Keseimbangan (Balance)','Penekanan (Emphasis)','Kesatuan (Unity)','Proporsi','Irama (Rhythm)','B',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22211,NULL,'Penggunaan warna biru dalam desain logo sebuah bank atau perusahaan teknologi bertujuan untuk memberikan kesan?',1,268,'3','Semangat dan energi','Kehangatan dan keramahan','Kepercayaan, stabilitas, dan keamanan','Keberanian dan kekuatan','Keberuntungan dan kesehatan','C',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22212,NULL,'Jarak antara huruf-huruf dalam sebuah kata, yang disesuaikan untuk meningkatkan keterbacaan atau estetika, disebut?',1,268,'3','Leading','Kerning','Tracking','Baseline','X-height','C',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22213,NULL,'Perangkat lunak yang paling efektif untuk membuat mockup antarmuka aplikasi mobile dan website adalah?',1,268,'3','Adobe Illustrator','Adobe InDesign','Adobe Premiere Pro','Adobe After Effects','Figma','E',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22214,NULL,'Komposisi desain yang menempatkan elemen-elemen secara tidak beraturan namun tetap menciptakan keseimbangan visual yang dinamis, disebut keseimbangan?',1,268,'3','Simetris','Asimetris','Radial','Vertikal','Horisontal','B',NULL,26,NULL,'2025-09-27 03:16:17',NULL),(22215,NULL,'Model warna yang bersifat aditif dan digunakan pada media berbasis cahaya (seperti monitor, televisi, dan proyekt