ll','Charging System','Hotel Information System','Telephone Feature','Semua Benar','E',NULL,150,NULL,'2025-09-30 09:14:56',NULL),(22699,NULL,'Surat-surat yang masuk ke Section Operator akan didistribusikan di box',1,137,'3','paging board','packing board','pigeon hole','semua salah ','semua benar','C',NULL,150,NULL,'2025-09-30 09:14:56',NULL),(22700,NULL,'Klasifikasi layanan telepon keluar, kecuali',1,137,'3','direct call','city call','collect call','personal call','SLI','A',NULL,150,NULL,'2025-09-30 09:14:56',NULL),(22701,NULL,'Peralatan yang ada di meja Belldesk, kecuali',1,137,'3','vallet parking','bellboy errand card','luggage tag','trolley','tray','E',NULL,150,NULL,'2025-09-30 09:14:56',NULL),(22702,NULL,'Grooming/ kebersihan diri bagi pegawai pariwisata meliputi',1,137,'3','gigi disikat bersih ','rambut laki harus pendek','perempuan tanpa cat kuku','parfume yang tidak menyengat','semua benar','E',NULL,150,NULL,'2025-09-30 09:14:56',NULL),(22703,'','<p>Candi Borobudur, located in central Java, Indonesia, is one of the most magnificent Buddhist temples in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage site. Built during the 8th and 9th centuries under the reign of the Sailendra Dynasty, this architectural masterpiece features a unique combination of Buddhist iconography and intricate stone carvings. The temple is renowned for its stunning stupa and intricate relief panels that tell the stories of the Buddha&#39;s life and teachings, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The structure of Borobudur is designed in the shape of a mandala, representing the universe in stone. It consists of nine stacked platforms, six square and three circular, topped by a central dome. Visitors ascend the temple in a clockwise direction, moving through various levels that symbolize the path to enlightenment. Each level is adorned with over 2,600 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues, each telling a different story and illustrating key teachings of Buddhism. As one climbs higher, the atmosphere shifts from the worldly realm to a more spiritual one, culminating in the serene dome at the top, where a large Buddha statue resides, symbolizing the ultimate state of enlightenment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The surrounding landscape of Borobudur enhances its beauty, with lush green hills and distant volcanoes framing the temple. Sunrise and sunset are particularly magical times to visit, as the temple becomes bathed in golden light, creating an unforgettable sight. The sound of birds chirping and the gentle rustle of leaves contribute to the peaceful atmosphere, making it a serene place for reflection and meditation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Borobudur is not only a remarkable architectural achievement but also a significant cultural and religious symbol for millions of Buddhists worldwide. Each year, thousands of pilgrims and tourists flock to this ancient temple to admire its beauty and immerse themselves in its rich history. The combination of its stunning design, intricate carvings, and breathtaking surroundings makes Candi Borobudur an extraordinary destination, offering a profound insight into Indonesia&#39;s spiritual heritage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In which country is Candi Borobudur located?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','Thailand','Malaysia','Indonesia','India','Vietnam','C',NULL,4,'2025-09-30 11:31:51','2025-09-30 11:33:33',NULL),(22704,'','<p>Candi Borobudur, located in central Java, Indonesia, is one of the most magnificent Buddhist temples in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage site. Built during the 8th and 9th centuries under the reign of the Sailendra Dynasty, this architectural masterpiece features a unique combination of Buddhist iconography and intricate stone carvings. The temple is renowned for its stunning stupa and intricate relief panels that tell the stories of the Buddha&#39;s life and teachings, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The structure of Borobudur is designed in the shape of a mandala, representing the universe in stone. It consists of nine stacked platforms, six square and three circular, topped by a central dome. Visitors ascend the temple in a clockwise direction, moving through various levels that symbolize the path to enlightenment. Each level is adorned with over 2,600 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues, each telling a different story and illustrating key teachings of Buddhism. As one climbs higher, the atmosphere shifts from the worldly realm to a more spiritual one, culminating in the serene dome at the top, where a large Buddha statue resides, symbolizing the ultimate state of enlightenment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The surrounding landscape of Borobudur enhances its beauty, with lush green hills and distant volcanoes framing the temple. Sunrise and sunset are particularly magical times to visit, as the temple becomes bathed in golden light, creating an unforgettable sight. The sound of birds chirping and the gentle rustle of leaves contribute to the peaceful atmosphere, making it a serene place for reflection and meditation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Borobudur is not only a remarkable architectural achievement but also a significant cultural and religious symbol for millions of Buddhists worldwide. Each year, thousands of pilgrims and tourists flock to this ancient temple to admire its beauty and immerse themselves in its rich history. The combination of its stunning design, intricate carvings, and breathtaking surroundings makes Candi Borobudur an extraordinary destination, offering a profound insight into Indonesia&#39;s spiritual heritage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During which centuries was Candi Borobudur built?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','5th and 6th centuries','7th and 8th centuries','8th and 9th centuries','9th and 10th centuries','10th and 11th centuries','C',NULL,4,'2025-09-30 11:36:21','2025-09-30 11:38:11',NULL),(22705,'','<p>Candi Borobudur, located in central Java, Indonesia, is one of the most magnificent Buddhist temples in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage site. Built during the 8th and 9th centuries under the reign of the Sailendra Dynasty, this architectural masterpiece features a unique combination of Buddhist iconography and intricate stone carvings. The temple is renowned for its stunning stupa and intricate relief panels that tell the stories of the Buddha&#39;s life and teachings, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The structure of Borobudur is designed in the shape of a mandala, representing the universe in stone. It consists of nine stacked platforms, six square and three circular, topped by a central dome. Visitors ascend the temple in a clockwise direction, moving through various levels that symbolize the path to enlightenment. Each level is adorned with over 2,600 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues, each telling a different story and illustrating key teachings of Buddhism. As one climbs higher, the atmosphere shifts from the worldly realm to a more spiritual one, culminating in the serene dome at the top, where a large Buddha statue resides, symbolizing the ultimate state of enlightenment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The surrounding landscape of Borobudur enhances its beauty, with lush green hills and distant volcanoes framing the temple. Sunrise and sunset are particularly magical times to visit, as the temple becomes bathed in golden light, creating an unforgettable sight. The sound of birds chirping and the gentle rustle of leaves contribute to the peaceful atmosphere, making it a serene place for reflection and meditation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Borobudur is not only a remarkable architectural achievement but also a significant cultural and religious symbol for millions of Buddhists worldwide. Each year, thousands of pilgrims and tourists flock to this ancient temple to admire its beauty and immerse themselves in its rich history. The combination of its stunning design, intricate carvings, and breathtaking surroundings makes Candi Borobudur an extraordinary destination, offering a profound insight into Indonesia&#39;s spiritual heritage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is the shape of Candi Borobudur designed to represent?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','A lotus flower','The universe','A mountain','A river','A stupa','B',NULL,4,'2025-09-30 11:40:50','2025-09-30 11:41:34',NULL),(22706,'Penilaian Tengah Semester','<p>Garis y = 2x &ndash; 3 ditranslasikan oleh T = (-2, 3). Persamaan bayangan garis tersebut adalah ...</p>\r\n',1,74,'5','<p>Y = 2x + 4</p>\r\n','<p>Y = 2x &ndash; 4</p>\r\n','<p>Y = 2x &ndash; 3</p>\r\n','<p>Y = 2x + 4</p>\r\n','<p>Y = -2x -3</p>\r\n','A',NULL,175,'2025-09-30 12:57:54','2025-09-30 12:59:59',NULL),(22707,'Penilaian Tengah Semester','<p>Jika garis y = x + 5 ditranslasikan oleh T = (2, 3) maka persamaan bayangannya adalah ...</p>\r\n',1,74,'5','<p>Y = x + 8</p>\r\n','<p>Y = x + 7</p>\r\n','<p>Y = x + 6</p>\r\n','<p>Y = x &ndash; 6</p>\r\n','<p>y =, x</p>\r\n','C',NULL,175,'2025-09-30 13:01:53','2025-09-30 13:01:53',NULL),(22708,'Penilaian Tengah Semester','<p>Koordinat bayangan titik (1, 0) oleh refleksi terhadap garis y = x + 1 adalah ...</p>\r\n',1,74,'5','<p>(0, 1)</p>\r\n','<p>(-1, 1)</p>\r\n','<p>(-1, 2)</p>\r\n','<p>(-2, 1)</p>\r\n','<p>(-2, 2)</p>\r\n','C',NULL,175,'2025-09-30 13:03:53','2025-09-30 13:03:53',NULL),(22709,'Penilaian Tengah Semester','<p>Jika setiap titik kurva y = x&sup2; ditranslasikan oleh (2, 1) maka kurva yang dihasilkan adalah ...</p>\r\n',1,74,'5','<p>Y = x? + 4x + 5</p>','<p>Y = x? + 2x + 1</p>','<p>Y = x? ? 2x + 1</p>','<p>Y = x? ? 2x + 3</p>','<p>Y = x? ? 4x + 5</p>','E',NULL,175,'2025-09-30 13:07:43','2025-09-30 16:14:13',NULL),(22710,'Penilaian Tengah Semester','<p>Sebuah segitiga ABC dengan A(2, 1); B(5, 3); C(3, 4). Bayangan segitiga ABC jika dicerminkan terhadap sumbu x adalah ...</p>\r\n',1,74,'5','<p>A&rsquo;(-2, -1); B&rsquo;(-5, -3); C&rsquo;(3, -4)</p>\r\n','<p>A&rsquo;(-2, 1); B&rsquo;(-5, 3); C&rsquo;(-3, 4)</p>\r\n','<p>A&rsquo;(2, -1); B&rsquo;(-5, 3); C&rsquo;(3, 4)</p>\r\n','<p>A&rsquo;(2, -1); B&rsquo;(-5, -3); C&rsquo;(-3, -4)</p>