NJIL','<p>Candi Borobudur, located in central Java, Indonesia, is one of the most magnificent Buddhist temples in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage site. Built during the 8th and 9th centuries under the reign of the Sailendra Dynasty, this architectural masterpiece features a unique combination of Buddhist iconography and intricate stone carvings. The temple is renowned for its stunning stupa and intricate relief panels that tell the stories of the Buddha&#39;s life and teachings, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The structure of Borobudur is designed in the shape of a mandala, representing the universe in stone. It consists of nine stacked platforms, six square and three circular, topped by a central dome. Visitors ascend the temple in a clockwise direction, moving through various levels that symbolize the path to enlightenment. Each level is adorned with over 2,600 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues, each telling a different story and illustrating key teachings of Buddhism. As one climbs higher, the atmosphere shifts from the worldly realm to a more spiritual one, culminating in the serene dome at the top, where a large Buddha statue resides, symbolizing the ultimate state of enlightenment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The surrounding landscape of Borobudur enhances its beauty, with lush green hills and distant volcanoes framing the temple. Sunrise and sunset are particularly magical times to visit, as the temple becomes bathed in golden light, creating an unforgettable sight. The sound of birds chirping and the gentle rustle of leaves contribute to the peaceful atmosphere, making it a serene place for reflection and meditation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Borobudur is not only a remarkable architectural achievement but also a significant cultural and religious symbol for millions of Buddhists worldwide. Each year, thousands of pilgrims and tourists flock to this ancient temple to admire its beauty and immerse themselves in its rich history. The combination of its stunning design, intricate carvings, and breathtaking surroundings makes Candi Borobudur an extraordinary destination, offering a profound insight into Indonesia&#39;s spiritual heritage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How many relief panels are found on the levels of Candi Borobudur?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','1,200','2,600','3,500','4,800','5,000','B',NULL,4,'2025-10-01 08:45:40','2025-10-01 08:47:15',NULL),(22852,NULL,'Candi Borobudur, located in central Java, Indonesia, is one of the most magnificent Buddhist temples in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage site. Built during the 8th and 9th centuries under the reign of the Sailendra Dynasty, this architectural masterpiece features a unique combination of Buddhist iconography and intricate stone carvings. The temple is renowned for its stunning stupa and intricate relief panels that tell the stories of the Buddha\'s life and teachings, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region.\r\n\r\nThe structure of Borobudur is designed in the shape of a mandala, representing the universe in stone. It consists of nine stacked platforms, six square and three circular, topped by a central dome. Visitors ascend the temple in a clockwise direction, moving through various levels that symbolize the path to enlightenment. Each level is adorned with over 2,600 relief panels and 504 Buddha statues, each telling a different story and illustrating key teachings of Buddhism. As one climbs higher, the atmosphere shifts from the worldly realm to a more spiritual one, culminating in the serene dome at the top, where a large Buddha statue resides, symbolizing the ultimate state of enlightenment.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding landscape of Borobudur enhances its beauty, with lush green hills and distant volcanoes framing the temple. Sunrise and sunset are particularly magical times to visit, as the temple becomes bathed in golden light, creating an unforgettable sight. The sound of birds chirping and the gentle rustle of leaves contribute to the peaceful atmosphere, making it a serene place for reflection and meditation.\r\n\r\nBorobudur is not only a remarkable architectural achievement but also a significant cultural and religious symbol for millions of Buddhists worldwide. Each year, thousands of pilgrims and tourists flock to this ancient temple to admire its beauty and immerse themselves in its rich history. The combination of its stunning design, intricate carvings, and breathtaking surroundings makes Candi Borobudur an extraordinary destination, offering a profound insight into Indonesia\'s spiritual heritage.\r\n\r\nWhat enhances the beauty of Candi Borobudur according to the text?',1,9,'1','Ancient artifacts','Modern sculptures','Lush green hills and distant volcanoes','Urban developments','Colorful gardens','C',NULL,4,'2025-10-01 08:50:24','2025-10-01 08:50:24',NULL),(22853,NULL,'Which sentence has the correct order of adjectives?',1,9,'1','The long, red, beautiful scarf','The red, long, beautiful scarf','The beautiful, long, red scarf','The beautiful, red, long scarf','The long, beautiful, red scarf','C',NULL,4,'2025-10-01 08:52:24','2025-10-01 08:52:24',NULL),(22854,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>What is the correct order for the adjectives in the sentence</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&quot;He owns ..., ..., ... a laptop&quot;?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','Slim, silver, powerful','Powerful, slim, silver','Silver, powerful, slim','Slim, powerful, silver','Silver, slim, powerful','B',NULL,4,'2025-10-01 08:54:31','2025-10-01 08:58:37',NULL),(22855,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>What is the correct order for the adjectives in the sentence</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&quot;They have a ..., ..., ... house&quot;?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1','Spacious, modern, blue','Modern, spacious, blue','Blue, spacious, modern','Spacious, blue, modern','Blue, modern, spacious','A',NULL,4,'2025-10-01 08:55:59','2025-10-01 08:59:26',NULL),(22856,'BAHASA INGGRIS, KELAS X, STS GANJIL','<p>Which sentence has the correct order of adjectives?</p>\r\n',1,9,'1'